Each is fetched from its original publisher at a pinned version and checked against a SHA-256 checksum.

Models
- Inkling 2 Mini (https://huggingface.co/thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini), by Thinking Machines Lab,
  Apache-2.0.
- Inkling-2-Mini-oQ2.5e-mtp (https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Inkling-2-Mini-oQ2.5e-mtp), MLX weights
  by the mlx-community, Apache-2.0, revision d4a4f3f (the drafter file is not downloaded).
- Inkling-2-Mini-AD-IQ3_XXS.gguf from AtomicChat/Inkling-2-Mini-GGUF
  (https://huggingface.co/AtomicChat/Inkling-2-Mini-GGUF), Apache-2.0, revision 0926b69.
- Ternary Bonsai 2 27B (https://huggingface.co/prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf), by PrismML, Apache-2.0,
  revision 839bd57; derived from Qwen3.8-27B by the Qwen team (Alibaba Cloud).

Engines
- oMLX (https://github.com/jundot/omlx), Apache-2.0, installed from its Homebrew tap (tested with 0.8.2).
  engine/inkserve.py runs on oMLX's Python stack and uses its Inkling 2 model code, chat handling and
  Inkling output parser; it replaces the model's KV caches and the global layers' decode attention.
- MLX and mlx-lm (https://github.com/ml-explore), MIT, Copyright Apple Inc., as shipped with oMLX.
- llama.cpp / ggml (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), MIT, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors.
  Prebuilt release b12600 (commit 29b52d3), which added the inkling2_loop architecture (PR #32694).
- PrismML llama.cpp fork (https://github.com/PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp), MIT, release prism-b10735-842b188,
  with the ternary PQ2_0 / PTQ1_0 kernels.

Method
- inference-optimisation-skill (https://github.com/sybil-solutions/inference-optimisation-skill), MIT, by
  Sybil Solutions: the ceilings-first, one-change-per-experiment tuning method behind docs/RECIPE.md.
